# =============================================================================
# Whitelist .gitignore
#
# This repo publishes ONLY code: the MCP servers (mcp-servers/), the automation
# scripts (scripts/), and the ship-locator relay/pusher (ship-locator/).
#
# Strategy: ignore everything by default, re-include the README + three code
# directories, then strip secrets, dependencies, and build artifacts back out even inside
# those directories. Personal data (the Obsidian vault, drafted docs, data
# exports, screenshots) is never tracked.
#
# NOTE: a .gitignore cannot protect a secret hard-coded in a source file. The
# code was audited (2026-06-18) — ship-locator and scripts read tokens only from
# env vars / external config, never literals. Keep it that way.
# =============================================================================

# --- 1) Ignore every top-level entry by default ------------------------------
/*

# --- 2) Re-include this file, the top-level README + LICENSE, the code
#        directories, and the releasable starter template ---------------------
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/scripts/
!/mcp-servers/
!/ship-locator/
!/template/

# --- 3) Personal / local data — never track (belt-and-suspenders for §1) -----
/AI Scratchpad/
/Documents/
/.claude/
/.playwright-mcp/
*.csv
*.png

# --- 4) Secrets & local config — stripped from EVERY directory ---------------
**/tokens.json
**/.tomorrow_token
**/.synoptic_token
**/.ship-relay.conf
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.sample
!**/.env.example
**/secrets.*
**/credentials*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
# Real relay config carries the read/push tokens; keep the *.sample.php template.
**/*.config.php
!**/*.config.sample.php

# --- 5) Dependencies & build artifacts (regenerable) -------------------------
# .mcpb bundles are zipped builds that can embed tokens.json — never publish.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/mcpb-build/
**/*.mcpb

# --- 6) Caches / junk --------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log

# --- 7) Local tool / editor config (nested too — not just root) --------------
**/.claude/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
